/ooc<P>Greetings, noble members of Principia Discordia! I am Velondra Dreamweaver, and I've come before you to ask your aid on a project I've been working on. For whatever reason (I'm not sure myself), I've decided to make it my goal to create the uber-list of guilds (past and present) for FV. I'm off to a good start, but I need your help to make further progress. I already have most of what I need for PC (except date founded and if you are still Active--hope so  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0"> ), so I'm mostly hoping you can help me with other guilds you may have been involved with. Here's the information I am seeking:<P>Guild name<BR>Restrictions (race, alignment, gender, level, etc.)<BR>Guildmaster<BR>Date founded<BR>Status (still active or dead guild)<BR>Guild number (i.e. /who all gx)<BR>Website<P>I've found a great deal of information already; if you're curious to see what I've done, here's the URL (and yes, I know I can't design web pages very well  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0"> ):<BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/sanctum_of_knowledge" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/sanctum_of_knowledge</A> <P>Thank you for your time!<P><BR>Velondra Dreamweaver,<BR>Voleuse de Reves<BR>&lt;League of Shadows&gt;
